  "description": "The X Gen 3 blends sleek design with top-tier performance, delivering a bike that's as efficient as it is striking. With a minimalist look, featuring the clean Poseidon logo on the top tube, the X mark on the seat tube, and our classic head badge, this bike makes a statement on and off the trail.\n\nUpgraded Performance Features\n\nDesigned with rider-focused upgrades, the X Gen 3 is built to excel on every ride. The frame now features a full thru-axle setup for enhanced stability and a brand-new full carbon fork, giving you the responsiveness and comfort you need for varied terrain. Based on rider feedback, we’ve also removed the fork mounts for a sleeker, more efficient design.\n\nThe X Gen 3 is equipped with the reliable Advent X drivetrain, offering the perfect balance of affordability and performance. You’ll experience precise gear changes with the Microshift Sword shifters and compressionless housing that ensures crisp shifting and confident braking—ideal for both climbs and steep descents.\n\nTire Clearance & Versatility\n\nNo matter your terrain, the X Gen 3 has you covered with ample tire clearance. It fits 700x40mm tires right out of the box, with the option to go up to 45mm* for even more cushion and stability. The upgraded wheelset with sealed cartridge bearings, paired with Continental Terra Trail tires, ensures a smooth, durable ride that’s ready for any adventure. Plus, with tubeless compatibility, you can ride longer with fewer worries.\n\nDesigned for Power and Control\n\nA Hollowtech-style external bottom bracket adds stiffness for better power transfer, helping you make the most of every pedal stroke. Whether you're pushing the limits on a steep descent or cruising on flat terrain, the X Gen 3 offers unmatched control and efficiency.\n\nLightweight & Ready to Ride\n\nAt just 22 lbs (without stock pedals), the X Gen 3 is designed to blend speed, efficiency, and affordability—because your best rides shouldn’t come with compromises. It’s built to handle the challenges of every mile, offering maximum performance at a price that makes sense.\n\nNew Color – Cascade Green\n\nA new generation means a fresh new look. Introducing Cascade Green, a stunning gradient from bright eucalyptus and sea foam green to deeper mineral green tones. It’s a true head-turner, adding a vibrant touch to every ride.\n\nFully Equipped for Your Next Adventure\n\nThe X Gen 3 is thoughtfully designed and ready to tackle any journey. We’ve packed more performance into every detail to bring you the best value in its class. Now, it’s time to start your ride. We built this for you—because every ride is a new challenge, and every mile tells a new story.\n\n*700 x 45mm tire clearance can range based on tire and rim combinations.",
